    "title": "Repository Management of Data Peer Review",
    "description": "Data repositories enable open science by providing access and supporting the use of the data and related products that are necessary for scientific progress. Providing peer review helps to ensure that scientific data products meet the criteria for quality and usability to serve the user communities of data repositories. Challenges and opportunities are described for data repositories to manage the peer review of scientific data.",
